WEBVTT

00:04:26.012 --> 00:04:32.184
My point is, let's start making space
in our organizations for moral language

00:04:32.184 --> 00:04:34.061
and clear moral arguments.

00:04:35.646 --> 00:04:36.939
Now --

00:04:36.939 --> 00:04:37.982
(Applause)

00:04:37.982 --> 00:04:39.942
There was a time in America

00:04:39.942 --> 00:04:42.903
when you could start as a custodian
or in the mail room

00:04:42.903 --> 00:04:45.489
and rise through the ranks,
even to the top job.

00:04:46.198 --> 00:04:48.451
Now that doesn't happen anymore.

00:04:48.451 --> 00:04:50.578
We have outsourced those jobs.

00:04:50.619 --> 00:04:52.496
We have turned them into gig work.

00:04:53.247 --> 00:04:57.835
And the problem is not just
the low wages or poor benefits

00:04:57.877 --> 00:05:00.629
or the unpredictable working hours.